{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-06_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-06","title":"握紧扶手","storyCode":"2-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ee366d2f1e0f11e2589a90400516ff046507236ea86497a761de678580637cc9","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"龙门贫民窟楼顶之间似乎确实可以用跳跃来进行转移。\n然而，本以为万无一失的妙招，似乎整合运动也想到了，战斗也在所难免。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十八关（后）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"还要上天台吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......这道门，这道门是锁着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"退后，让我用法术把门锁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"踹开就得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇，多学学。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"各有各的风格不行吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......前面是屋顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"阿米娅，那边！从那边就能到另外一边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“那边”是哪......你是说我们可以从——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"从楼顶转移？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Bingo——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能想到呢！万无一失了是不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门啊，可是一座有着很多秘密的好——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"别想跑——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"......咦？这什么呀？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，敌人也用意想不到的方式出场了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经堵住了入口，怎么会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是从附近的建筑里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们背着的喷气背包虽然比较简陋，但是好像完全不影响使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让他们从没有设防的地方进来的话，就不妙了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"切，等着，我马上去救你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻烦你动作快些了，拉特兰的救世主小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"重装小队，防御阵型！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家，掩护先锋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
